  "manual": "A733 User Manual V1.00 sections4.1(CCU),15.2(TV1),15.4(DP),18.2(SERDES); manual pin remains in sources.lock.json.",
  "source_selection": "bsp/drivers/drm/Makefile selects trilinear_dp14.o with CONFIG_AW_DRM_TRILINEAR_EDP14. The A733 manual DP register offsets independently match the adapter. The cached A733 kernel build configuration enables this option; that configuration is a comparison input, not a runtime dependency.",
  "boundary": "Four-lane DP-only C/E,1.62Gb/s,26MHz raw oscillator,720p60 RGB888,one retained DE1 RGB565 frame. AUX host rate is an independently qualified cold-profile fact, not inferred from the Linux hardcoded200MHz FIXME. Physical negotiation/link/output and independent drain remain unqualified.",
